flowchart TD
  Auth[Authenticate]
  Connect[Connect wallet and check account and chain]
  Prompt[Enter natural-language instruction]
  AI[Backend generates intent draft]
  Review[Review and edit structured intent]
  Policy[Backend policy evaluation]
  Allowed{Allowed and current?}
  Sim[Backend transaction simulation]
  Risk[Backend risk analysis]
  Results{Results current and usable?}
  Add[Add individually verified transaction to batch]
  Final[Final batch validation]
  Exact{Exact reviewed payload valid?}
  Confirm[User reviews exact batch and contract call]
  Wallet[Explicit MetaMask approval request]
  Status[Track submission and confirmation]
  Fix[Correct intent and re-evaluate]
  Stop[Stop; show reason and preserve safe context]
  Recheck[Account, chain, or payload changed: invalidate and revalidate]

  Auth --> Connect --> Prompt --> AI --> Review --> Policy --> Allowed
  Allowed -->|no or indeterminate| Fix
  Fix --> Review
  Allowed -->|yes| Sim --> Risk --> Results
  Results -->|failed, stale, or unknown| Stop
  Results -->|current| Add --> Final --> Exact
  Exact -->|no| Stop
  Exact -->|yes| Confirm --> Wallet --> Status
  Connect -. context changed .-> Recheck
  Review -. material edit .-> Recheck
  Recheck --> Policy
  Wallet -. rejected or failed .-> Stop
